        "created_at": "2011-11-02T16:40:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When I first found out about SotM, I was surprised to find that I could only get it through their website, but I understood because it was so new (PAX had just happened the weekend before).  But now, has any of that changed?  If I go into a local game store, are they still going to stare at me blankly when I mention the game’s name, or can they finally fill their shelves with copies?  If they can’t order the game yet through their normal distribution channels, why is that?  What has to happen before anyone anywhere can buy this game?</p>",
