        "created_at": "2011-11-02T21:40:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When I first found it, it was mid to end July and it was at Table Top Games and Hobbies, which is one of my local stores. And while I was looking at it everyone was like “man that game is so awesome” or “i’m really looking foward to learning how to play it” so maybe you should switch stores if they can’t handle the awesomeness that is known as Sentinels of the Multiverse?</p>",
