        "user_title": "Chief Justice",
        "title_is_group": false,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Since we are a new company, our rollout to distributors took a while.  Tabletop had the games early because Christopher knows the owner Phil, who is a cool guy :)  However, starting now, Sentinels is available from a number of distributors around the world, and we are working on increasing that number all the time.  If your local store doesn't have the game, let them know they should; that is one of the best ways to help us out that does not involve spending any money :)",
